[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010900_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010900_03_0010","text":"哦……\n果穗，你看那边"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010900_03_0020","text":"是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010900_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010900_03_0001","text":"举旗值班的家长"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010900_03_0030","text":"大家好——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010900_03_0040","text":"你好……咦，\n你不是我们学校的孩子呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010900_03_0050","text":"……小宫果穗同学？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010900_03_0060","text":"是的！\n我是放学后CLIMAX GIRLS的小宫果穗！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010900_03_0070","text":"感谢你们一直守护着我们！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010900_03_0080","text":"因为有『守护系统』在，\n我们才能每天元气满满地去上学！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010900_03_0090","text":"我虽然不是这里的学生……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010900_03_0100","text":"今后也请多多关照！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02010900_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
